udevelopers.in/kalpataru-aurum","title":"Kalpataru Aurum Baner Call 08698487118 Floor Plans, Price, Amenities, Reviews & Location details.","content":"Where is Kalpataru Aurum Baner exactly located?  \n Kalpataru Aurum Baner by Kalpataru Developers is a residential project located at Baner.  \n  \n What are the configurations available at Kalpataru Aurum Baner?  \n Kalpataru Aurum Baner offers 2BHK residential apartments.   \n  \n What is the possession status of Kalpataru Aurum Baner?  \n It will be ready to move in by 2024.  \n  \n What are the amenities provided at Kalpataru Aurum Baner?  \n Amenities at Kalpataru Aurum Baner include an equipped gymnasium, recreational play parks for children, landscaped greenery, swimming pool for all age groups, jogging tracks, clubhouse, 100% electric/power backup, designated parking spots and 24/7 round the clock security services.  \n  \n What happens if I have any more questions/clarifications? [...] Presenting Kalpataru Aurum Baner a beautiful project, a well-planned living space which is the hallmark of thoughtfully laid out flats at reasonable prices. Kalpataru Aurum Baner brings a lifestyle that befits royalty with its beautiful apartments at Baner. Your home will now serve as a perfect get-away after a tiring day at work, as Kalpataru Aurum Baner will make you forget that you are living in the heart of the city. These residential apartments in Baner offer luxurious homes that amazingly escape the noise of the city centre. The beautiful views and cross ventilation make your home a peaceful abode. In addition to that, there are a number of benefits of living in apartments with a good locality. Kalpataru Aurum Baneris conveniently located at Baner to provide unmatched connectivity [...] RERA No :P52100033791\n\nOverview\n\nKalpataru Aurum Baner\n\nKalpataru Aurum Baner is innovatively planned 2BHK residences will offer breath-taking views of manicured & landscaped courtyards, the city & the urban infrastructure across the